{
  "_comment": [
    "Example fixture manifest for tools/mint_parity_receipt.py.",
    "",
    "The complete-frame parity receipts under evidence/ are minted from two",
    "private scanner captures that are not redistributable and are not in",
    "this repository. This file documents the manifest that points the",
    "minting script at them; copy it, fill in real paths, and pass it with",
    "--fixtures or PORTABLE_DICE_FIXTURE_MANIFEST.",
    "",
    "Relative paths resolve against workspace_root (or --workspace-root).",
    "Every *_sha256 field is a pin: the script refuses to run when the bytes",
    "on disk do not match, so a substituted or truncated fixture fails loudly",
    "instead of minting a receipt about different data. The pinned values",
    "below are the real ones for the two published validation frames, and",
    "they also appear in evidence/*.json and docs/validation.md.",
    "",
    "The Nikon oracle is not needed to mint these receipts: parity is",
    "established against the in-process baseline backend and bound to",
    "expected_logical_output_sha256, which is the oracle-matched CPU",
    "reference hash. The oracle fields are accepted and ignored."
  ],
  "schema": "portable-digital-ice-private-validation-manifest-v1",
  "workspace_root": "/absolute/path/to/the/workspace/holding/the/fixtures",
  "profile": {
    "scanner_model": "nikon-super-coolscan-5000-ed",
    "mode": "normal",
    "selector": 8,
    "resolution_metric": 4000,
    "bit_depth": 16,
    "prepass_dpi": 285,
    "main_dpi": 4000,
    "prepass_variant": "native-exact"
  },
  "cases": {
    "frame1": {
      "main": "relative/or/absolute/path/to/frame1/main.dicein1",
      "main_sha256": "368a9fdb230ee8d6ed88b3c30e7f22c947051a3a62d4e4f22043cc02e7c3275e",
      "prepass": "relative/or/absolute/path/to/frame1/prepass.dicepp1",
      "prepass_sha256": "3756c15e20a396189392b86db1c2172e117f5d45abd25964d11740ce3c72934a",
      "expected_main_rgbi16_raw_byte_sha256": "542832fa404572a2460968bc2bc585f0c7595d06eaab6a319bb26a87b3536551",
      "expected_prepass_rgbi16_raw_byte_sha256": "3b5a091ccad3f9f783b0e8bb78221d49b1b77bad55feaa66d88cd240cb35b2db",
      "expected_logical_output_sha256": "c3ee49f49f71cbc544da595901522d945f549464f0f3b9a543e98171e56f6ad7",
      "expected_shape_hwc": [5782, 3946, 3],
      "expected_compared_rgb16_samples": 68447316
    },
    "frame2": {
